	(gr_text "NORTH (+Y): J1 PJ-063AH, J4 USB-C, J5 REF IN, J10 REF OUT. SOUTH: J9 RFOUT B, J7 RFOUT A. Board 45.0 x 64.0 mm. Assumptions, verify with calipers: extrusion outside 50 x 20 x 80 mm; PCB in side slots so width is 45 mm with 1.5 mm copper-free strips on both long edges (anodized slots, so the strips are bare of copper). Inside height assumed 16 mm, inside length assumed 76 mm; the extrusion can be sawn shorter. End-plate thickness and the slot height above the floor are unknown. 142-0701-801 is not a flanged bulkhead: round hole about 6.4 mm for the 0.250 in barrel, or about 8 mm if the 0.312 in hex must pass. PJ-063AH is about 9 mm above the PCB and 3.3 mm below; a centered 16 mm slot does not fit it. SMA hex needs the slot at least 4 mm off the floor. USB, SMA, and the barrel are not colinear. BMI-S-209-F is 7.0 mm tall (about 7.2 mm assembled); BMI-S-209-F-20 (2.0 mm frame) drops in. Headers J2 J6 J8 stand about 8.5-11 mm. JP1 pads 1-2 bridged: local TCXO. Cut 1-2 and bridge 2-3 for REF IN. R30 fitted is the REF OUT DC link; remove R30 and fit C42 to AC-couple."
		(at 47.5 60 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "83939b8a-c0ea-43df-ab1d-e9e9be74167a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "64.0 mm"
		(at 47.4 32 90)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "003254e6-ec48-4e1a-9bc0-830d1aa10c60")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
			)
		)
	)
